{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE3L1RoZSUyMEJyaWRlJTIwJTI4MjAxNyUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"The Bride","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/aKKanGgtgHxrdb1e7OKxbvpio04.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/me5utxTz6hlEgAeQisexKHP27ZU.jpg","description":"This is a story of a small town girl named Nastya. Her newly married husband Ivan drives her to his hometown to meet his family. Upon their arrival Nastya feels she made a wrong decision: she is surrounded by weird people and she sees creepy photos all around the house. Ivan disappears while his family prepares Nastya for a mysterious traditional Russian wedding ceremony. She struggles to calm herself down hoping all this will end and they will live happily ever after. Only if she stays alive...","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["Mystery","Horror","Thriller","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.8","runtime":"90 min","cast":["Victoria Agalakova","Vyacheslav Chepurchenko","Aleksandra Rebenok","Igor Khripunov","Anastasia Akatova","Viktor Solovyov","Dmitriy Kulichkov","Miroslava Karpovich"],"director":["Svyatoslav Podgaevsky"],"released":"2017-01-19T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Victoria Agalakova","character":"Nastya","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hvpwja9coyNJzsdMEAAO2uubD98.jpg"},{"name":"Vyacheslav Chepurchenko","character":"Ivan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vxveAHsNxBv0d1ZMb2FzlQiW6kA.jpg"},{"name":"Aleksandra Rebenok","character":"Liza","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uKeh3hWQWjTXQC58NGyPwHAF3D5.jpg"},{"name":"Igor Khripunov","character":"Viktor","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/k9Nw2mZlLAtbZOJdTmnbX4Vj8hK.jpg"},{"name":"Anastasia Akatova","character":"Nastya’s neighbor","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/m4nLxsJSedlDOCNxVu2nzNzZTWb.jpg"},{"name":"Viktor Solovyov","character":"Ivan and Lisa's father","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uvpukeeR7oa0IPzlP1Vc1HALi7J.jpg"},{"name":"Dmitriy Ku